.660" end="00:31.740"><span begin="00:27.660" end="00:27.868">And </span><span begin="00:27.868" end="00:28.152">I </span><span begin="00:28.152" end="00:28.364">don't </span><span begin="00:28.364" end="00:28.918">need </span><span begin="00:28.918" end="00:29.268">your </span><span begin="00:29.268" end="00:31.740">saving</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.423" end="00:35.220"><span begin="00:32.423" end="00:32.652">'Cause </span><span begin="00:32.652" end="00:32.884">highs </span><span begin="00:32.884" end="00:33.325">like </span><span begin="00:33.325" end="00:33.701">this </span><span begin="00:33.701" end="00:34.132">come </span><span begin="00:34.132" end="00:34.602">once </span><span begin="00:34.602" end="00:35.220">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.653" end="00:38.540"><span begin="00:35.653" end="00:35.829">And </span><span begin="00:35.829" end="00:36.132">I </span><span begin="00:36.132" end="00:36.487">don't </span><span begin="00:36.487" end="00:37.167">wanna </span><span begin="00:37.403" end="00:38.150">waste </span><span begin="00:38.150" end="00:38.540">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.540" end="00:41.494"><span begin="00:38.540" end="00:38.987">Don't </span><span begin="00:38.987" end="00:39.384">care </span><span begin="00:39.384" end="00:39.751">if </span><span begin="00:39.751" end="00:40.198">it </span><span begin="00:40.198" end="00:41.079">kills </span><span begin="00:41.079" end="00:41.494">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.198" end="00:44.703"><span begin="00:42.198" end="00:42.374">Or </span><span begin="00:42.374" end="00:42.630">I </span><span begin="00:42.630" end="00:43.031">lose </span><span begin="00:43.031" end="00:43.470">my </span><span begin="00:43.470" end="00:44.703">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.982" end="00:47.403"><span begin="00:44.982" end="00:45.151">But </span><span begin="00:45.151" end="00:45.226">if </span><span begin="00:45.226" end="00:45.410">you </span><s